<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Touching Thee in faith, I take Thee</l><l>In Thy riches full and free;</l><l>All I am I open to Thee,</l><l>All Thou art Thou giv’st to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Touching now Thine outstretched scepter,</l><l>O most mighty King of kings;</l><l>Of Thy fulness now receiving,</l><l>High I mount on eagle wings.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Grace and virtue, strength and wisdom,</l><l>All my need, by Thee supplied;</l><l>Keep me touching, keep me claiming,</l><l>Keep me ever at Thy side.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
